# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-wide environment variables for the KWS site.
#
# Next.js loads this .env in EVERY environment — ⁠ next dev ⁠ AND the
# production ⁠ next start ⁠ server. Load order (later wins):
#   .env  →  .env.development / .env.production  →  .env.local
# So keep real values here; do NOT re-declare the same keys in .env.local
# (an empty key there would override these and break the form).
#
# SECURITY: .env is gitignored (.gitignore has ⁠ .env* ⁠), so these secrets
# stay out of version control. For a hosted deploy (Vercel, a VPS, etc.),
# set the same variables in the host's environment settings instead of
# shipping this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Maps Embed API key (Contact page map). Client-visible by design.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSyBJyBp1b7-uYHKbdfc1fDCYnCAHrsOt_oE

# ─── Contact form email (SMTP via Nodemailer) — used by app/api/contact/route.ts ───
SMTP_HOST=smtp.whoisworks.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=kws@koreawithsue.co.kr
SMTP_PASS=kws2026@@
# Where inquiries are delivered:
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=kws@koreawithsue.co.kr
# The "From" address (optional — defaults to SMTP_USER). Gmail requires this
# to match the authenticated account.
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=koreawsuesocial@gmail.com